  "raw": " Batman hair, in self-defense because he didn't expect to have to deflect a surprise punch at the end of their powers session.\n\n'Slippery' Steve James laughed while saying seriously speaking: \"If anyone can manipulate this, its Achilles. I imagine he'll use His telepath with full access to this, now that no one can stop it.\"\n\n\"Achilles,\" Shoyo added, suspiciously pushing it out of her mind. \"What we need is a divine source for its power. One thing we know, though, is that no matter where such power comes from, the transfer of data is extensive and vast.\"\n\n\"Achilles' repository is guarded with full security,\" Ryder replied while looking at the requisite database. \"And that database contains every book, speech and the thoughts of hundreds of parents of children who could have a divine biologic.\"\n\nYoung Oracle and the Time Reborn's Viper showed up in the yard working on the yard",
